WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
EDITOR + EITRI — The recording starts with an existing, customized workspace.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
BROWSER — Open the problem and use Competitive Companion to send its samples to Eitri.

00:08.000 --> 00:21.500
EDITOR + EITRI — The local solution is open on the right; sample input and answers appear in the terminal on the left. Edit and save.

00:21.500 --> 00:25.000
EITRI — Review the local sample verdict. AC means the samples passed.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.470
BROWSER / EDITOR — Compare the problem’s samples with the local results. Press c in Eitri to copy a prepared solution for manual submission.
